OL,3,GNEWSAMotorbike rider sentenced after
OL,4,Awoman injured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who left a woman seriously
OL,7,Finjured after he crashed into her on an
OL,8,Felectric motorbike has been given a
OL,9,Fsuspended jail sentence.
OL,11,FO'Shea Gordon-Lucas, 23, of Preston,
OL,12,FLancashire, was riding a Sur-Ron Light
OL,13,FBee at about 18:00 GMT on 3 November
OL,14,F2025 in Elgar Road, Reading.
OL,16,FCourt papers state the woman, in her
OL,17,F50s, was left with PTSD and bleeding on
OL,18,Fthe brain. Her skull, right eye socket
OL,19,Fand right wrist were fractured.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
