OL,3,GNEWSAMotorbike rider sentenced after
OL,4,Awoman injured in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FGordon-Lucas, who admitted causing
OL,7,Fserious injury by careless or
OL,8,Finconsiderate driving, was given a
OL,9,F36-week jail sentence, suspended for 24
OL,10,Fmonths.
